hash fbebd7bf775647d6
note The header runs and the button list, built once here for both measuring and drawing: step number, name, off-path tag, file:lines; then more/less, context above, below and none (never while collapsed), listing, and the two expansions. An expansion that is open says 'hide N' and closes on a click; a closed one is offered only when it would actually reveal something, so a button whose targets are all on the canvas already is not drawn at all rather than doing nothing when pressed.

step wu5v06
order 2
parent 1fwzx4
author ai
file src/gui/graph.rs
symbol rebuild
lines 0 99
hash a2e3d0c8d20d1975
note The derivation, run every frame: clear, then one node per step of the selected path at its depth in the tree (its slice as the line range, its note kept for the header; a step with no symbol of its own takes the symbol its first line sits in, else the file's first symbol (a file with no symbols gives no node), and a step that gets no node at all hands its children to its parent so the tree keeps its shape), then the focused symbol as its own root when no step already shows it, with its callers and its callees opened once so an off-path jump lands in a neighbourhood rather than on a lone box (auto_open remembers that root, so closing them afterwards sticks), then the expansions in the order they were opened. A dragged position is kept only while its node still exists. A node cut to a preview shows only its own lines: its context applies once it is opened again.

